0
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,760
ADDITIONAL PRAYER.

1
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:06,470
May Buddha's tenets become popular everywhere.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,690
Heavenly guards always protect Buddha's disciples.

3
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:15,090
Monks, nuns, and laities can reach sainthood quickly.

4
00:00:15,770 --> 00:00:18,980
Boundless blessings to the good contributors.

5
00:00:19,590 --> 00:00:22,910
The country is prosperous in the rule of wise leaders.

6
00:00:23,570 --> 00:00:26,990
The novices are trying hard to strengthen their devotion.

7
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:30,220
The world is peaceful and humans are happy.

8
00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:34,760
May Buddha bless us to be absolutely loyal to our Master.

9
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:38,710
All beings in the universe can be enlightened.

10
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:41,540
Namo Shakya Muni Buddha.
